---
import DeliverabilityBeforeAfter from "./DeliverabilityBeforeAfter.astro";

/**
 * Deliverability proof section — brands hit inbox/spam problems; we document fixes.
 * Case studies: Saint Candles · Men's jewelry brand (anonymized).
 */
---

<section
    id="deliverability-proof"
    class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-100 via-white to-white"
>
    <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[min(100%,480px)] h-[480px] bg-emerald-200/20 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/4"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="section-container relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
            <p
                class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-800/90 mb-4"
            >
                Deliverability
            </p>
            <h2
                class="font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl text-e2-black tracking-tight mb-5 text-balance"
            >
                If you don&apos;t land in the inbox, nothing else matters.
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-balance">
                A lot of founders know email feels broken: opens tank, promos
                land in spam, but they{' '}
                <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold"
                    >don&apos;t know how to fix deliverability</strong
                >. That&apos;s the job. This section is{' '}
                <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold">proof</strong> we do:
                DNS, reputation, warming, sends that scale. Two recent wins: Saint
                Candles{' '}
                <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold"
                    >deliverability turned around in under 60 days</strong
                >, and a high-ticket men&apos;s jewelry brand we took from{' '}
                <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold"
                    >LOW domain reputation to HIGH</strong
                >, then 3× attributed revenue.
            </p>
        </div>

        <DeliverabilityBeforeAfter
            beforeSrc="/deliverability-proof/hero-before-klaviyo-summary.png"
            afterSrc="/deliverability-proof/saint-after-business-summary-2026.png"
            beforeWidth={1024}
            beforeHeight={808}
            afterWidth={1024}
            afterHeight={447}
            beforeAlt="Before: Klaviyo business performance summary for Saint Candles. Attributed revenue only about 4% of total, campaigns at zero, flows-only revenue."
            afterAlt="After: Klaviyo business performance summary for Saint Candles. $36,142.67 attributed revenue (45.86% of total), campaigns and flows both live, up 72% versus the previous period."
            compareLabel="Klaviyo (Saint Candles)"
        />

        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-6 text-center">
            <span
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200/80 bg-emerald-50/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-900/90"
            >
                Case study · Saint Candles
            </span>
        </div>

        <div
            class="rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-200/80 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50 overflow-hidden"
        >
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0">
                <!-- Metrics -->
                <div class="p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-14 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-gray-100">
                    <p
                        class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-2"
                    >
                        Outcome after inbox health (first month on program)
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-emerald-800/90 font-semibold mb-8">
                        Deliverability fixed first, then these numbers became possible.
                    </p>

                    <figure
                        class="mb-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <img
                            src="/deliverability-proof/saint-candles-campaign-dashboard.png"
                            alt="Klaviyo campaign overview for Saint Candles showing 51.38% open rate from 9,510 recipients, click rate, revenue, and engagement over time."
                            class="w-full h-auto object-contain object-top bg-gray-100"
                            loading="lazy"
                            width={1024}
                            height={695}
                            decoding="async"
                        />
                        <figcaption
                            class="px-4 py-3 text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-600 text-center border-t border-gray-100 bg-white"
                        >
                            Live Klaviyo report ·{" "}
                            <strong class="text-gray-900">51.38% open</strong> · 9,510
                            recipients · $916 attributed revenue · segmented send after
                            placement work
                        </figcaption>
                    </figure>

                    <div class="flex items-end justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8 mb-10">
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <div
                                class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-gray-400 tabular-nums tracking-tight"
                            >
                                4%
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mt-2"
                            >
                                Before
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1 tabular-nums">
                                $2,041
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="pb-6 text-emerald-600/80 text-2xl font-black"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                            →
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <div
                                class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-emerald-800 tabular-nums tracking-tight"
                            >
                                46%
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="text-xs text-gray-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mt-2"
                            >
                                After
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 font-semibold mt-1 tabular-nums">
                                $36,143
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-8">
                        <div
                            class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100/80 p-4 text-center"
                        >
                            <div
                                class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-emerald-900 tabular-nums"
                            >
                                +55%
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="text-[10px] text-emerald-900/70 uppercase font-bold tracking-wide mt-1"
                            >
                                vs prior year
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 p-4 text-center"
                        >
                            <div
                                class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-e2-black tabular-nums"
                            >
                                46.9%
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold tracking-wide mt-1"
                            >
                                Open rate · recent send
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 p-4 text-center col-span-2 sm:col-span-1"
                        >
                            <div
                                class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-e2-black tabular-nums"
                            >
                                21.7k
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold tracking-wide mt-1"
                            >
                                Recipients · same campaign
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
                        List size keeps growing while we stay in{' '}
                        <strong class="text-gray-700 font-semibold"
                            >safe deliverability</strong
                        >, so sends scale to more people, not the same shrinking
                        segment.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Story / proof -->
                <div
                    class="p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-emerald-50/25 flex flex-col justify-center"
                >
                    <blockquote
                        class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 border-l-4 border-emerald-600 pl-6"
                    >
                        &ldquo;Klaviyo went from a thin slice of the business to
                        nearly half of revenue in the first month,{' '}
                        <strong class="text-gray-900"
                            >up 55% versus the prior year</strong
                        >. The list keeps growing and we&apos;re still in safe
                        deliverability territory; the last major send cleared a{' '}
                        <strong class="text-gray-900">46.86% open</strong>{' '}
                        with room to scale.&rdquo;
                    </blockquote>
                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-6">
                        <span class="font-bold text-gray-900">Account update</span>
                        · Saint Candles · deliverability, copy &amp; design
                    </div>

                    <figure
                        class="mb-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-emerald-100/80 bg-white shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <img
                            src="/deliverability-proof/hero-after-deliverability-score.png"
                            alt="Klaviyo deliverability score 80 labeled Good, up 12 points over the previous 30 days, with open rate, click rate, bounce, and spam metrics versus benchmarks."
                            class="w-full h-auto max-w-full object-contain object-top bg-gray-50"
                            loading="lazy"
                            width={1024}
                            height={485}
                            decoding="async"
                        />
                        <figcaption
                            class="px-4 py-3 text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-600 border-t border-gray-100 bg-white"
                        >
                            <strong class="text-gray-900">Deliverability score</strong>
                            · 80 (Good) · +12 vs prior 30 days · inbox factors in range
                        </figcaption>
                    </figure>

                    <div
                        class="rounded-2xl bg-white/80 border border-emerald-100/80 p-6 shadow-sm"
                    >
                        <p
                            class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-3"
                        >
                            Before we kicked off
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                            On our first call, Andy&apos;s main issue wasn&apos;t
                            copy. It was{' '}
                            <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold"
                                >deliverability</strong
                            >, and he{' '}
                            <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold"
                                >didn&apos;t know how to fix it</strong
                            >
                            on his own. He was ready to hand that layer to a team,
                            walked us through where the last setup failed (including a
                            Loom so we didn&apos;t repeat the same mistakes), and we got
                            DNS and placement work moving fast.{' '}
                            <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold"
                                >Deliverability was fixed inside the first 60 days</strong
                            >. The revenue lift is what happens when mail actually reaches the list.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Case study 2 — Men's jewelry brand (anonymized) -->
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 mt-20 md:mt-24 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200/80">
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-balance">
                High-ticket custom jewelry: when domain reputation is stuck at{' '}
                <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold">LOW</strong>, opens
                sit near single digits and email barely registers on the P&amp;L.
                Fix placement first, then scale sends.
            </p>
        </div>

        <DeliverabilityBeforeAfter
            beforeSrc="/deliverability-proof/jewelry-brand/before-klaviyo-summary.png"
            afterSrc="/deliverability-proof/jewelry-brand/after-klaviyo-summary.png"
            beforeWidth={1812}
            beforeHeight={760}
            afterWidth={2388}
            afterHeight={1060}
            aspectWidth={1812}
            aspectHeight={760}
            beforeAlt="Before: Klaviyo conversion summary for a men's jewelry brand. About $8,500 attributed in 30 days, flows only, zero campaign revenue."
            afterAlt="After: Klaviyo business performance for a men's jewelry brand. $33,473 attributed (34.36% of total revenue), campaigns and flows both contributing, email and SMS live."
            compareLabel="Klaviyo (Men's jewelry brand)"
            beforeCaption="~$8.5k attributed · 30 days · flows only · ~7% of total revenue"
            afterCaption="~$33k attributed · 34% of total · campaigns + flows · email & SMS"
        />

        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-6 text-center">
            <span
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200/80 bg-emerald-50/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-900/90"
            >
                Case study · Men&apos;s jewelry brand
            </span>
        </div>

        <div
            class="rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-200/80 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50 overflow-hidden"
        >
            <!-- 1. The problem -->
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-14 border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50">
                <p
                    class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-2"
                >
                    The problem
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
                    High-ticket custom jewelry — grillz, cubans, chains. The list
                    existed, but{' '}
                    <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold"
                        >domain reputation was LOW</strong
                    >, Gmail opens sat under 10%, and Klaviyo was only{' '}
                    <strong class="text-gray-900 font-semibold"
                        >~7% of total revenue</strong
                    >. Campaigns could not scale until placement was fixed.
                </p>

                <figure
                    class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto"
                >
                    <img
                        src="/deliverability-proof/jewelry-brand/before-open-rate.png"
                        alt="Klaviyo reports showing 9.34% open rate and $617 revenue over 30 days before deliverability repair for a men's jewelry brand."
                        class="w-full h-auto object-contain object-top bg-gray-50"
                        loading="lazy"
                        width={1355}
                        height={1099}
                        decoding="async"
                    />
                    <figcaption
                        class="px-4 py-3 text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-600 text-center border-t border-gray-100 bg-white"
                    >
                        <strong class="text-gray-900">Before repair</strong>
                        · 9.34% open · $617 in 30 days · placement blocking scale
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>

                <div class="flex items-end justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8 mt-10 max-w-md mx-auto">
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <div
                            class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-400 tabular-nums tracking-tight"
                        >
                            7%
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mt-2"
                        >
                            Of total revenue
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1 tabular-nums">
                            ~$8k / 30d attributed
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="pb-5 text-gray-300 text-xl font-black"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                        ·
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <div
                            class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-400 tabular-nums tracking-tight"
                        >
                            9%
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mt-2"
                        >
                            Open rate
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">
                            Gmail under 10%
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. The fix -->
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-14 border-b border-gray-100">
                <p
                    class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-2"
                >
                    The fix
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
                    Our deliverability lead ran Gmail repair, inbox warmup, and
                    DMARC hardening. Sends stayed conservative until Google
                    Postmaster showed trust coming back — then we expanded
                    segments and turned on product-specific flows.
                </p>

                <figure
                    class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100/80 bg-white shadow-sm overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain"
                >
                    <img
                        src="/deliverability-proof/jewelry-brand/domain-reputation.png"
                        alt="Google Postmaster Tools domain reputation chart showing progression from Low to Medium to High over two months for a men's jewelry brand."
                        class="w-full min-w-[280px] h-auto max-w-none sm:max-w-full object-contain object-top bg-gray-50"
                        loading="lazy"
                        width={4560}
                        height={1952}
                        decoding="async"
                    />
                    <figcaption
                        class="px-4 py-3 text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-600 text-center border-t border-gray-100 bg-white"
                    >
                        <strong class="text-gray-900">Domain reputation</strong>
                        · LOW → MEDIUM → HIGH · Google Postmaster · ~8 weeks
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. The outcome -->
            <div
                class="p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-emerald-50/25"
            >
                <p
                    class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-800/90 mb-2"
                >
                    The outcome
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-emerald-800/90 font-semibold mb-8">
                    Reputation HIGH · opens recovered · attributed revenue tripled
                </p>

                <figure
                    class="mb-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-emerald-100/80 bg-white shadow-sm"
                >
                    <img
                        src="/deliverability-proof/jewelry-brand/after-open-rate-flows.png"
                        alt="Klaviyo flow reports for a men's jewelry brand showing 38.8% open rate, 2.65% click rate, and 0.33% bounce rate over the last 7 days."
                        class="w-full h-auto object-contain object-top bg-gray-100"
                        loading="lazy"
                        width={2484}
                        height={1056}
                        decoding="async"
                    />
                    <figcaption
                        class="px-4 py-3 text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-600 text-center border-t border-gray-100 bg-white"
                    >
                        Live Klaviyo report ·{' '}
                        <strong class="text-gray-900">38.8% open</strong> on flows
                        · Gmail at 35.5% · bounce 0.33% · last 7 days
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>

                <div class="flex items-end justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8 mb-10">
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <div
                            class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-gray-400 tabular-nums tracking-tight"
                        >
                            7%
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mt-2"
                        >
                            Before
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1 tabular-nums">
                            ~$8k / 30d
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="pb-6 text-emerald-600/80 text-2xl font-black"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                        →
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <div
                            class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-emerald-800 tabular-nums tracking-tight"
                        >
                            34%
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="text-xs text-gray-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mt-2"
                        >
                            After
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 font-semibold mt-1 tabular-nums">
                            $33,473
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    <div
                        class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100/80 p-4 text-center"
                    >
                        <div
                            class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-emerald-900 tabular-nums"
                        >
                            3×
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="text-[10px] text-emerald-900/70 uppercase font-bold tracking-wide mt-1"
                        >
                            attributed revenue
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-emerald-100/80 p-4 text-center"
                    >
                        <div
                            class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-e2-black tabular-nums"
                        >
                            9% → 39%
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold tracking-wide mt-1"
                        >
                            Open rate · flows
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-emerald-100/80 p-4 text-center col-span-2 sm:col-span-1"
                    >
                        <div
                            class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-e2-black tabular-nums"
                        >
                            LOW → HIGH
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold tracking-wide mt-1"
                        >
                            Domain reputation
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <blockquote
                    class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-emerald-600 pl-4 sm:pl-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto"
                >
                    &ldquo;Reputation hit{' '}
                    <strong class="text-gray-900">HIGH</strong>, flows cleared{' '}
                    <strong class="text-gray-900">38%+ opens</strong>, and
                    attributed revenue{' '}
                    <strong class="text-gray-900">tripled to ~$33k</strong> in 30
                    days. Campaigns went from zero to{' '}
                    <strong class="text-gray-900">34% of attributed revenue</strong
                    > once Gmail trusted the domain again.&rdquo;
                </blockquote>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-4 text-center">
                    <span class="font-bold text-gray-900">Account update</span>
                    · Men&apos;s jewelry brand · deliverability, flows &amp; campaigns
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-500 mt-8">
            Figures from brand Klaviyo reporting · domain charts from Google Postmaster · verified client outcomes
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
